		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gargantuan aquatic psychic eel with jaws within jaws. Information brokers for their aboleth masters.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 4, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +8 (2d8 + slime) or 3 thought barrage, <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Slime</strong>. CON 15+ or target gains a magical curse, turning into a translucent deep one over 2d10 days.</p><p></p><p><strong>Telepathic</strong>. Speak mentally with aboleth and deep-sea aberrations on same plane.</p><p></p><p><strong>Thought Barrage</strong>. Bolt of blue psychic energy. One target within far, CHA 15+ or stunned 1 round.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
